{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309550","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309550","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130955001:1":{"text":"고향으로 돌아가려고요.","source_cn":"我、我要回到我出生的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4F93DA9D0DA06E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130955002:1":{"text":"여긴 너무 위험해요! 세일린워터 마을의 사람들도 그렇고… 주변의 마을도 그렇고, 절대 저를 받아주지 않을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"这里太危险了！咸水镇的人……还有周围的部落，都绝对不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9F79EA588B1FD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130955003:1":{"text":"게다가 저는 사막의 발톱에 속아서 들어간 거란 말이에요! 어쩌면 우리 가족들이 저를 찾고 있을지도 모른다고요!","source_cn":"而且，我是被骗进流沙之爪的！说不定，我的家人还一直在找我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26BC6C6A2123163B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130955004:1":{"text":"돌아가기 전에 일단 옷부터 갈아입어야 할 것 같아요…","source_cn":"不过，在回去之前，我得先把这身衣服换掉才行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE44F7BACD43300F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流沙之爪提克斯":{"text":"테쿠스","source":"流沙之爪提克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}